    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the next <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>. Can be <a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a> in case the\ncurrent <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is already the last one. Clients should check <a href=\"#hasNext()\"><code>hasNext()</code></a> before calling this method.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>以请求下一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>。如果当前的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>已经是最后一个，则可以调用<a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>。客户端在调用此方法之前应检查<a href=\"#hasNext()\"><code>hasNext()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the previous <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>. Can be <a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a> in case the\ncurrent <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is already the first one. Clients should check <a href=\"#hasPrevious()\"><code>hasPrevious()</code></a> before calling this\nmethod.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>，用于请求上一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>。如果当前的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>已经是第一个，则返回<a href=\"Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>。客户端在调用此方法之前应检查<a href=\"#hasPrevious()\"><code>hasPrevious()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A slice of data that indicates whether there's a next or previous slice available. Allows to obtain a\n<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request a previous or next <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "指示是否存在下一个或上一个数据片段的切片。允许获取一个<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>，以请求上一个或下一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the next <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
